stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Checking: user picks profile / game launch detected
  Checking --> Blocked: game running
  Blocked --> Checking: game exits
  Checking --> DeviceMismatch: profile needs a device that is not connected
  DeviceMismatch --> Checking: device plugged in / user picks another profile
  DeviceMismatch --> Writing: user accepts "write anyway"
  Checking --> Writing: all devices present
  Writing --> Snapshot: snapshot current Bindings folder
  Snapshot --> Apply: write .binds + StartPreset.4.start (temp + rename)
  Apply --> Verify: re-read and hash-compare
  Verify --> Active
  Verify --> Rollback: mismatch
  Rollback --> Idle
  Active --> FallbackDetected: game log shows "Missing devices" or StartPreset no longer names our preset
  FallbackDetected --> Active: user quits game, astromech restores from snapshot
  Active --> Idle
